{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-26T13:16:04+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Commerce admin lists products by name and adds one with name and SKU. Manage Stock is not asked. Products stay Commerce records. Clicking a product shows Regular and Sale. The clerk presses Save. 12 or 12.00 shows 12.00. 12.5 and $12 save as 12.50 and 12.00. Blank Sale clears Sale. Blank Regular unprices the product. $0 shows 0.00. 12.999, a letter, or a minus is refused and stored prices stay unchanged. Sale must be lower than Regular. Clearing Regular while a Sale remains is refused. Duplicate SKU is refused. SKU is stored uppercase. No commit."}, "event_id": "6ee0b4c5-734f-4aac-aea6-3b4db1bf2f39"}
